flowchart TD
  Start([Inbound HTTPS request]) --> Bounds[Validate method, path, headers and body size]
  Bounds --> Valid{Request valid?}
  Valid -->|No| Reject400[400 or 413]
  Valid -->|Yes| Context[Create trusted request context]
  Context --> Auth[Verify identity]
  Auth --> AuthOK{Authenticated?}
  AuthOK -->|No| Reject401[401]
  AuthOK -->|Yes| Route[Resolve explicit route]
  Route --> Exists{Route registered?}
  Exists -->|No| Reject404[404]
  Exists -->|Yes| Permission[Authorize permission]
  Permission --> Allowed{Allowed?}
  Allowed -->|No| Reject403[403]
  Allowed -->|Yes| Upstream[Call fixed upstream with deadline]
  Upstream --> Result[Map safe response or error]
  Result --> Finish([Return correlation ID])
